The program displays the basic analysis and visualizations of the mall customer dataset.

Dataset contains 250 customers and 5 columns.
Average customer age is 38.49 years.
Customer gender count:
Female: 137
Male: 113
Average annual income is 95.59 k$.
Displays an Age Distribution histogram to understand customer age patterns.
Displays an Income vs Spending Score scatter plot to analyze customer spending behavior.
Creates customer segments based on income and spending score.
